SUMMARY:VS Code Live: June Recap of Releases
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nVS Code ships every week. Once a mo
 nth\, the VS Code and GitHub Copilot product teams pick the updates worth 
 a closer look\, demo them live\, and answer your questions in real time. J
 oin us for June!\n\n***\n\n* [Learn Visual Studio Code](https://aka.ms/VSC
 ode/Learn)\n* [Awesome Copilot](https://aka.ms/AwesomeCopilot)\n* [Learn m
 ore about the series](https://developer.microsoft.com/reactor/series/S-152
 1/?wt.mc_id=meetup_27398_webpage_reactor)
