SUMMARY:So You Want to Become a Microsoft MVP?
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nJoin us for an exciting journey int
 o the Microsoft MVP Program!\n\nWhether you’re a tech enthusiast\, a com
 munity leader\, or someone passionate about sharing knowledge\, this sessi
 on will give you exclusive insights into what it means to be a Microsoft M
 ost Valuable Professional (MVP).\n\nDiscover who MVPs are and the impact t
 hey make Learn how to apply and what it takes to become one Hear firsthand
  experiences from current MVPs and their inspiring journeys.\n\nUnderstand
  the benefits and opportunities of being part of this global community Thi
 s is your chance to connect with MVPs\, ask questions\, and take your firs
 t step toward becoming a part of this incredible family.\n\nDon’t miss o
 ut\, register now!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3152
 15572/
