SUMMARY:Inside the Mind of a Dataviz World Champion
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nWhat does a Dataviz World Champion 
 actually do differently? It’s not just design skills. It’s how they th
 ink\, how they spot the story\, and how they turn data into something peop
 le feel. Join recent finalists Santhana Lakshmi Ponnurasan and Michał Jez
 ik as they break down how they approach dashboards from the first spark of
  an idea to the final polished result.\n\nReal examples\, real decisions\,
  real insight. Come see how champions think—and walk away inspired to le
 vel up your own work.\n\nPre-requisites:\nFind a contest: Https://aka.mdd/
 create\nLearn more about the World Championships: https://aka.ms/nextworld
 champs\n[Register for Data Days)[https://aka.ms/datadays)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3153
 32779/
